            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Canada is the only country in the world with a national healthcare plan that does not include drug coverage. Coverage of necessary medications is a patchwork of inconsistent programs that does not always serve the very individuals it was created to help-those patients who need prescribed medicines. Our system needs radical, intuitive changes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
